      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe your host in **Host**: how they look and what they wear.\n3. Press **Run**. Both images are saved under `image/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        430,
