          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst draws the host from the waist up, in a portrait frame. `arguments` holds the model's own settings, written by the names fal gives them: here `image_size` and `quality`. **Model: Info** lists every setting a model takes.\n\nTo draw with another model, open **Design** and type another `model`, the model's name on fal."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        860,
        60
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        108
