          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**File: Add** passes the host image's fal link, its address on fal storage, to the edit as `image_urls`, the field where the model takes the images to edit. Nothing is uploaded again. GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst then draws the same person waving.\n\nChange the prompt in **Turn** to pose the host another way. Set `quality` in `arguments` to `low` or `medium` for quick drafts."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
